			"notes": "Possibly fixed [pets being voided through specific teleportation sequences](https://github.com/MagicJinn/Better-Pet-Teleporting/issues/2).\nFixes [pets sometimes not teleporting at render distance 2 or 3](https://github.com/MagicJinn/Better-Pet-Teleporting/issues/3).\n\nMakes pets immune to certain types of damage, which helps them not die during teleportation:\n- Falling out of the world\n- Fall damage\n- Cramming\n- Suffocating in a wall (caused by cramming pushing them into a wall)"
